Corresponding source
--------------------
The complete corresponding source of this binary, with the scripts that build and install it, is the release
asset {source_name} (sha256 {source_sha256}), published in the same release as this component's archive
{kit_name}{source_where}. It lists the upstream commit and which upstream files were changed (PROVENANCE.txt).
